ERST,   TAD I   LINST           /GET POINTER TO START OF LINE
        DCA     GETBASE         /AND SETUP GETHAF BASE POINTER
        DCA     GETNDX          /START AT BEGINNING
        DCA     SCHAR           /CLEAR SEARCH CHARACTER
